{"id":"seventh-seraph-saw","name":"Seventh Seraph SAW","type":"Machine Gun","tier":"Legendary","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/29093fbaa9a7a03baa3936a359f85113.jpg","screenshot":"/common/destiny2_content/screenshots/2582755344.jpg","columns":[{"label":"Barrel","weight":1,"perks":[{"name":"Arrowhead Brake","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8f7fb54687aa52a9c2595d90ce9c9417.png","desc":"Lightly vented barrel.\n  •  Greatly controls recoil\n  •  Increases handling speed"},{"name":"Chambered Compensator","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0b451cbccc7f11f6aec9c153e59474cb.png","desc":"Stable barrel attachment.\n  •  Increases stability\n  •  Moderately controls recoil\n  •  Slightly decreases handling speed"},{"name":"Corkscrew Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7730e1732ed7ef91afce50277639c493.png","desc":"Balanced barrel. \n  •  Slightly increases range and stability\n  •  Slightly increases handling speed"},{"name":"Extended Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d9e5e8fa07a84c29252b78b0e7b3106d.png","desc":"Weighty barrel extension.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Decreases handling speed\n  •  Moderately controls recoil"},{"name":"Fluted Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/260eba9dd149dbb94b1306c9ed4dd8db.png","desc":"Ultra-light barrel. \n  •  Greatly increases handling speed\n  •  Slightly increases stability"},{"name":"Full Bore","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/40a4bdcf0f5a4e492927f9569eaf529d.png","desc":"Barrel optimized for distance.\n  •  Greatly increases range\n  •  Decreases stability\n  •  Slightly decreases handling speed"},{"name":"Hammer-Forged Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/2b9eb6d4489cffc18c10223279198bcc.png","desc":"Durable ranged barrel.\n  •  Increases range"},{"name":"Polygonal Rifling","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7d7aaccee29cf450d4057a9de871cdc8.png","desc":"Barrel optimized for recoil reduction.\n  •  Increases stability"},{"name":"Smallbore","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7d1bb6a623f14959a47156ee71acfc3a.png","desc":"Dual strength barrel.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Increases stability"},{"name":"Full Choke","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/629246e67fc8690d56b5478b0262131a.png","desc":"Tightened barrel. Reduces projectile spread when aiming down sights at the cost of precision damage."},{"name":"Rifled Barrel","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/79d5f1f469d3290cfb849f4b3e6fc16b.png","desc":"Ranged shotgun barrel.\n  •  Increases range\n  •  Greatly decreases handling speed"}]},{"label":"Magazine","weight":1,"perks":[{"name":"Seraph Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/5e825cbfd6fbcef65358f27334368681.png","desc":"Rounds overpenetrate targets and bounce off hard surfaces.\n• Slightly increases range\n• Increases stability"},{"name":"Accurized Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d85024478504205359c7fb52dbc4f6b6.png","desc":"This weapon can fire longer distances.\n  •  Increases range"},{"name":"Appended Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d9f468cce26fe35d9db413e2f8451127.png","desc":"This weapon's magazine is built for higher capacity.\n  •  Increases magazine size"},{"name":"Tactical Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/f0e309a267b25279a871d182f8910bcc.png","desc":"This weapon has multiple tactical improvements.\n  •  Slightly increases stability\n  •  Increases reload speed\n  •  Slightly increases magazine size"},{"name":"Extended Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/66cfea124e24e73cca1ce6370b44ca7e.png","desc":"This weapon has a greatly increased magazine size, but reloads much slower.\n  •  Greatly increases magazine size\n  •  Greatly decreases reload speed\n  •  Increases airborne effectiveness"},{"name":"Steady Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/6c6e1cc341487a8afd0b0c714a229255.png","desc":"This magazine is optimized for recoil control.\n  •  Greatly increases stability \n  •  Slightly decreases range\n  •  Increases airborne effectiveness"},{"name":"Alloy Magazine","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/069170916c98748b7b3e33b80bd7d689.png","desc":"Faster reload when the magazine is nearly empty."},{"name":"Flared Magwell","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/f95e67e4ff37466505d66d3fa1030782.png","desc":"Optimized for fast reloading.\n  •  Slightly increases stability\n  •  Greatly increases reload speed"},{"name":"Armor-Piercing Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b311ef00478243e21e2a5eec3a59f9d8.png","desc":"Rounds cause extra damage to combatants' shields and overpenetrate targets. \n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"High-Caliber Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9d1c49edb2d2b24c74067742c09fd5a5.png","desc":"Shots from this weapon knock the target back farther.\n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"Ricochet Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0a494d0442b32aff8c30d8b2b53561bd.png","desc":"Rounds ricochet off hard surfaces. \n  •  Increases stability \n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"Light Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/736b486ddb80beefacb4f09b5ad016eb.png","desc":"Improved reload and range.\n  •  Increases reload speed\n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"Drop Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9d19f0c349652f0285bb5f999307b8a1.png","desc":"Increases reload speed but reduces magazine size."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Reconstruction","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9b0c09a784bc7af2f7d038e3626832a9.png","desc":"This weapon slowly reloads itself over time, up to double capacity."},{"name":"Attrition Orbs","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/c2092fae6ae58ca77a7f9b4434e688ef.png","desc":"Dealing sustained damage creates an Orb of Power."},{"name":"Light Touch","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/46b000a4e8c4ffa73df16c26a63360e0.png","desc":"This weapon gains reload speed, handling, and aim down sight speed when you are amplified, radiant, or have Devour."},{"name":"Collective Demolition","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/47894c30f18dabf52f84aa514b63b5ea.png","desc":"Collecting an Elemental pickup or destroying a Tangle grants this weapon a stacking period of grenade energy generation on hit. Throwing a Tangle provides additional time.\n\nElemental pickups include [Solar]Firesprites, [Void]Void Breaches, [Arc]Ionic Traces, [Stasis]Stasis Shards, and [Strand]Strand Tangles."},{"name":"Grave Robber","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/043d100167af67d6041719044a033221.png","desc":"Melee final blows or dealing damage with a charged melee reloads this weapon's magazine from reserves."},{"name":"Supercharged Magazine","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b17b5725c96e59f838ae045b8433f8df.png","desc":"While amplified, ammo is gradually transferred from reserves to the magazine. \n\nWhile in Speed Booster, ammo regenerates faster and overflows the magazine."},{"name":"Trickle Charge","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/17b696e766f345273ddfdda22c8a06f6.png","desc":"Receiving or discharging Bolt Charge partially loads the magazine from reserves."},{"name":"Zen Moment","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9650a58cd3a439bf3b53a53dbc8122a0.png","desc":"Causing damage with this weapon reduces recoil and flinch over time."},{"name":"Clown Cartridge","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/794d65813703324c653878def082ca66.png","desc":"Reloading this weapon randomly overfills it from reserves."},{"name":"Auto-Loading Holster","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/e4262099a1c2cea78b48a6680c5248c9.png","desc":"The holstered weapon is automatically reloaded after a short period of time."},{"name":"Field Prep","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/4ee1ecaead6fe2de1a2cab07f8b7be3f.png","desc":"Increases ammo generation. Faster reload, stow, and ready speed when you're crouching."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Firing Line","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/92a5e8dbef32a414709d3196cb815d89.png","desc":"This weapon deals increased precision damage when near two or more allies."},{"name":"Killing Tally","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a64f5d3e972ea35b1789f62999235083.png","desc":"Kills increase this weapon's damage until it is stowed or reloaded."},{"name":"Jolting Feedback","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/27270b6f5da035b05fa797c82bb6a10d.png","desc":"Dealing repeated damage with this weapon inflicts Jolt. \n\nWhile amplified, Jolt is applied faster."},{"name":"Mega Kill Clip","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d033d35fb47c550e74bd023e61002ef0.png","desc":"Reloading after a final blow grants a period of increased damage. Additional final blows before reloading further increases the duration of the damage period."},{"name":"Onslaught","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/7e07db21ba2b35751507256e46230616.png","desc":"Final blows with this weapon increase its rate of fire."},{"name":"Meganeura","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b5378713f840558b0641deb21bbe6c08.png","desc":"Precision final blows create an elemental damage explosion that deals more damage based on the number of rapid precision hits dealt beforehand."},{"name":"Rolling Storm","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/086174f30d9fbf5e68f473dac9eda710.png","desc":"Final blows grant Bolt Charge.\nWhile amplified, final blows grant additional Bolt Charge."},{"name":"Vorpal Weapon","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/bc5130b227ee577f2678ec2d2c97bf4a.png","desc":"Increased damage against bosses, vehicles, and Guardians with their Super active."},{"name":"Opening Shot","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/276e8ce23910c6ee2a6b88b076a2004c.png","desc":"Improved accuracy and range on the opening shot of attack."},{"name":"Mulligan","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8ca9b9caef4c4c5c0c19d3be25be3755.png","desc":"Missing a shot has a chance to return ammo directly to the magazine."},{"name":"Disruption Break","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/45b57ce27fa0213218c7cb8f2253c517.png","desc":"Breaking an enemy's shield with thi